  "description": "UQAVUH crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H51 Br4 Eu4 N7 O27,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Eu2 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu1 (Eu) has 10 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 10 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.705-5.056 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.19-163.71°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C64H48Br4Eu4N7O28.",
